# Aura Workforce — Database Migrations

This directory contains database revision scripts and migration environments managed by Alembic.

## Common Migration Commands

```bash
# Apply all pending migrations to database head:
alembic upgrade head

# Roll back all migrations to clean base:
alembic downgrade base

# Create a new autogenerated revision:
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe_changes"

# Check current revision:
alembic current
```